{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"type":"noauth"},{"scopes":["openid"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Read stored observations or forecast history for source and var. Forecast source uses forecast:model and requires spot. Public access covers the latest 72 hours; a free Gillby account (OAuth sign-in) allows windows up to 31 days; up to 1000 points. Latest revision/run wins. Rejected and suspect rows are excluded; unreviewed rows retain quality metadata.\nFor chop history or trends use get_chop_history with a verified spot ID. Preserve recorded versus reconstructed provenance, native 0\u201310 index and labels, coverage and gaps. Never invent assistant-defined rough/calm thresholds or silently substitute wave/wind series for native chop.\nUnits: ft, kt, s, F, mi; directions FROM. Returns data and source/freshness metadata.","icons":[{"mimeType":"image/svg+xml","sizes":["64x64"],"src":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,"}],"inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"query":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"from":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"maxPoints":{"default":500,"maximum":1000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"source":{"maxLength":80,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"spot":{"maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9:._-]+$","type":"string"},"to":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"var":{"maxLength":40,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["source","var"],"type":"object"}},"required":["query"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_history","securitySchemes":[{"type":"noauth"},{"scopes":["openid"],"type":"oauth2"}],"title":"Stored environmental history"}
